  {
    "id": "1953760525525168291",
    "author": {
      "id": "1725169104963657728",
      "username": "AztecaAlpaca",
      "name": "阿兹特克小羊驼",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019350943930937348/0z3zAknf_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "个人主义和社会孤立：大革命和新体制打破了传统的中间阶级和社会组织，使个人成为原子化的个体，社会凝聚力减弱，促进了对中央政权的信赖和依赖，专制的风险加大。",
    "created_at": "2025-08-08T10:09:43.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 0,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": null,
      "quote_count": null,
      "view_count": null,
      "impression_count": null
    },
    "media": null,
    "entities": {
      "urls": [],
      "hashtags": [],
      "mentions": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "1953760527970447422",
    "author": {
      "id": "1725169104963657728",
      "username": "AztecaAlpaca",
      "name": "阿兹特克小羊驼",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019350943930937348/0z3zAknf_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "托克维尔强调，法国人对平等的追求常常超过对自由的渴望，他们毁掉旧的特权与阶级，却很容易把权力交给新的集权政府。长期的集权和等级制惯性，使法国社会更难形成真正多元、自治、自主的结构。 他警示，“只有一件事是不能摧毁的，中央集权。”",
    "created_at": "2025-08-08T10:09:43.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 0,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": null,
      "quote_count": null,
      "view_count": null,
      "impression_count": null
    },
    "media": null,
    "entities": {
      "urls": [],
      "hashtags": [],
      "mentions": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "1953760523084001722",
    "author": {
      "id": "1725169104963657728",
      "username": "AztecaAlpaca",
      "name": "阿兹特克小羊驼",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019350943930937348/0z3zAknf_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "官僚主义与经济结构：政府主导经济和官僚治理导致资源分配不公，社会发展失去活力。改革激发了社会压迫感，旧的不平等未消除，新不平等随之产生。",
    "created_at": "2025-08-08T10:09:42.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 0,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": null,
      "quote_count": null,
      "view_count": null,
      "impression_count": null
    },
    "media": null,
    "entities": {
