  {
    "id": "1953760516960399845",
    "author": {
      "id": "1725169104963657728",
      "username": "AztecaAlpaca",
      "name": "阿兹特克小羊驼",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019350943930937348/0z3zAknf_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "中央集权：法国社会的核心是中央集权制。无论是旧制度还是大革命后的体制，这种集权现象只是形式改变，权力却更加集中在国家机器手中，个体和中间团体被消解，个人变得孤立而依赖强政府。",
    "created_at": "2025-08-08T10:09:41.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 0,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": null,
      "quote_count": null,
      "view_count": null,
      "impression_count": null
    },
    "media": null,
    "entities": {
